1. OWNERSHIP

   Zoe-System, including its source code, documentation, design, data
   structures, Firebase rules, audit tooling, scripts, configuration and
   all other content in this repository, is the exclusive property of
   MENGSROY HEN ("the Owner"). All rights reserved.

2. NO IMPLIED GRANT

   Viewing, downloading, receiving a copy of, or contributing to this
   repository grants no ownership interest and no licence of any kind.
   All rights not expressly granted in writing are reserved.

   Sole exception: when this repository is made public on GitHub, GitHub
   users may view and fork it on GitHub only to the extent required by
   the GitHub Terms of Service. This exception grants no right to use,
   run, modify, copy outside GitHub, or distribute any content, and every
   fork remains fully subject to this document. Making the repository
   public waives none of the Owner's rights.

3. RESTRICTIONS

   Without the Owner's prior written permission, no person or entity may:

   a. Copy, reproduce or retain any content beyond the purpose the Owner
      has specifically authorised.
   b. Distribute, publish, transfer, sell, rent or sublicense it.
   c. Modify it, create derivative works, or incorporate it into any
      other product or service.
   d. Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble it.
   e. Remove, obscure or alter any proprietary notice, including this
      LICENSE and the NOTICE file.
   f. Use this content to train, evaluate or develop any artificial
      intelligence or machine learning model.
   g. Build, run, deploy or host the application from this source code
      (end-user rights to run the application exist only under
      section 5).
   h. Circumvent, disable, remove or alter the Activation Key, licensing
      or any protection mechanism of the system.

4. CONTRIBUTIONS

   Every contribution (commit, patch, design, documentation or other
   content) made by any employee, contractor or collaborator is a work
   made for hire, and all intellectual property rights in it vest in the
   Owner automatically upon creation, with no further instrument needed.

5. END-USER LICENCE (SEPARATE)

   This document governs ownership of the source code only. End-user
   rights to run the application are governed separately by an
   Activation Key issued from ZoeKeyGen — each key is signed with
   ECDSA P-256, carries an expiry date, and may be revoked or extended
   by the Owner at any time.

   Holding an Activation Key grants no rights whatsoever in the source
   code.

6. THIRD-PARTY CODE

   Certain files in this repository are owned by third parties and are
   governed by their own licences, not by this document. The complete
   inventory and licence texts are in the NOTICE file.

7. BUSINESS DATA

   Data processed by this system (phone numbers, parcels, COD/DOD
   amounts and other customer data) belongs to the business operating
   the system, not to the Owner of the software.

8. NO WARRANTY

   This system is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind,
   express or implied, including the warranties of merchantability,
   fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement.

9. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY

   In no event shall the Owner be liable for any damages whatsoever,
   including loss of data, loss of revenue or business interruption,
   arising out of the use of or inability to use this system.

10. GOVERNING LAW

   This document is governed by and construed under the laws of the
   Kingdom of Cambodia.

11. LANGUAGE

   The Khmer text (Part 1) is the original and legally authoritative
   version. This English translation (Part 2) is provided for
   information only. In case of any discrepancy, the Khmer text
   prevails.
